Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,работали,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Над серией работали:\N Лилия, Тирамису, Ананас, Зингер, Бирюлька
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.20,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.68,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,We'll have to take an extreme step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:39.35,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,And he is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:42.78,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,-What is this? \N-I should ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.76,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,While I was drinking, I thought that the moonlight would be enough for my mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.16,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,so I blew out the candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:53.30,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I wanted to stretch my throat before I started drinking for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.77,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You can consider this a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.66,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.88,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.74,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Didn’t you want to warm each other’s throats?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.87,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What a cunning asshole. Did he do it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.38,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,No, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.76,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Since we have warmed our throats,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.59,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,start drinking heartily, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:19.73,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:22.02,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,One person is not interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:25.74,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Somehow I didn’t think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.16,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Pour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.55,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warm-up welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.57,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,now the wine has flown softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:42.65,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What? What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.38,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Here, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:52.15,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You should drink too, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.20,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,The king drinks first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.40,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,No, the queen drinks first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.93,0:02:58.90,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Changed strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:02.13,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I know your dark thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:06.81,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Then let's have a glass
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.27,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,and to bed, fortunately it was a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.77,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Yes, we have just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:13.92,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Don’t be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:17.59,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Come on. One salvo for my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.12,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.56,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I sleep lightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.12,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,so stay away while we sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.90,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What kind of game is he playing with such and such nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:43.08,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Blooms during the day, withers at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.78,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,These tales about the king’s love for alcohol and women...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.96,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Chronicles about Joseon lie like the yellow press.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.68,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I was scared in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:00.72,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,But we must not let down our vigilance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.74,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Finally using it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.67,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,woman’s knot, which I learned in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:12.40,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,If you want to untie it, you will have to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:13.64,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Frets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:20.68,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Damn selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.65,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Took up the whole bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:35.22,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:37.99,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I understand your feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.43,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,but today I just want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.94,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Everything is wrong. I was raised in comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:44.87,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I can’t sleep on a bare floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:46.58,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.78,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I can’t sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:51.08,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,less than three feather beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.47,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I’m sure your comfort cannot compare with that of a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:01.52,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,That lumberjack prince from Ganghwa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.86,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,obviously I didn’t study history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:22.64,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Yolki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.35,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,To break his sleep paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:35.25,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Since everything turned out this way,\NI will be on guard all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:39.95,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,For some reason today I still remember the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:57.31,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,2 episode: Nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.47,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Are you awake, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:59.11,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Here is an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:02.18,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Hopefully not, but I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:07.98,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What is it like to greet a new day as a queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:10.01,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.12,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:17.18,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,My woman's knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:24.03,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Lost something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:26.54,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,-I'll search everything... \N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:31.74,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I’m sure I untied it at night, interfered, I suppose. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.12,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.72,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,When did you arrive in Hijeongjon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:24.56,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Sorry for not accompanying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:28.82,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to wake the queen and left quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.26,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Are you having nightmares again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:37.13,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,She shouldn't lose sleep because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:39.31,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,It's her first day as queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:44.00,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I will bring you Arabic jasmine tea and you will sleep well tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:51.58,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,The queen must now be greeting the ladies of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:54.36,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I heard they've already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:58.23,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,It’s curious what the queen looks like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:06.17,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,The wedding was yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:08.94,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,why didn’t I wake up, how are things going again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.01,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You should go and greet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:13.18,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,the Dowager Queen and the Queen Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:16.50,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,and hold a festive ceremony for the court officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:18.81,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,After the official part of the wedding ceremony...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:20.68,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,When will the wedding end?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:23.99,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,No, then His Majesty must read the message
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:25.29,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,about your proclamation as queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:30.03,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Some kind of endless wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:34.16,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Just a minute. So the Queen Dowager is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:37.33,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,This is an order from the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:40.83,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I will fill the lake with water -\NI will go against her order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:47.33,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What kind of person is the Queen Dowager?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.14,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Dowager Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.05,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,like you, from the Andon clan of Kim, she is an elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:55.52,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,and the queen mother is from the Pungyang Cho family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:10:00.06,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,So my acquired granny and mommy are at enmity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.82,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,And I, the queen, are of the same kind as the granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:05.03,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Can I ask her when I see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:07.35,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,The older one is the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:09.46,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:14.80,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I really care, will you tell me everything you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.91,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,She is Mr. Kim Jwageun's sister
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.73,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,and hasn’t left the palace since she arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.10,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,-Also... \N-Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:28.92,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the palanquin. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:32.21,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,-Stop! \N-Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:37.93,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:40.93,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Roll back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:43.06,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Roll back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:49.67,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:59.44,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Something more important has emerged here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:36.52,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Lost because the palace is too big?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:43.89,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.69,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:53.06,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I’ll never get used to this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.04,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You have such an attractive aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:01.91,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Are you from the royal family too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.15,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of princess there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:07.75,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:11.08,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,If I was arrogant and upset you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.58,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:15.79,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,No. What I'm trying to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:16.89,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:19.85,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You walk so fast. How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.16,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:25.80,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.54,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,This is Mrs. Hwajin from the Cho family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.54,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,future royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.58,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I understand that the queen is on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.21,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,but didn’t she insult you too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.75,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Continues to play with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.95,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,There are rumors that it is she
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:41.55,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,pushed you into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:44.79,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I am sure that the rumor about the queen losing her memory is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:46.85,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,-Be careful. \N-Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:59.40,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I have known so many women,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.30,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,that I can easily read their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.83,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,You... How can I say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.47,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.92,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I think things didn’t work out for us in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.71,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,so maybe we can start again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:17.65,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:20.81,Default,BIR,0,0,0,,Let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:27.59,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Have you decided to change tactics?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:29.90,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Tactics?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:33.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I learned\Nwhat the palace is like,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.71,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,was finally able to understand that I am now also part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:40.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,No, it looks like you misunderstood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.94,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,-Everything is wrong.\N-Sorry, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.31,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:53.36,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I came to your chambers,\Nbut you were not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:56.26,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I wanted to greet you too, but I couldn’t find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:58.82,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,That's how we must have missed each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:01.19,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,because our thoughts converge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.90,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,If she is a concubine,\Nit turns out that she is considered a second wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.04,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Why this body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Why this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:16.20,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Fire in the eyes of the queen can burn the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:23.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Rent yourself a room already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:25.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,My queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.68,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I ask you to quickly tell the royal concubine what and how.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.66,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What a shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.60,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I don’t have time to explain everything to her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.96,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,This is the king's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.06,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Fuck polygamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:46.68,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:50.01,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The queens have been waiting for you for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:52.01,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:56.61,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I have a very important meeting, I’ll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.22,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:07.95,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:14.00,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Very scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:17.54,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Hwajin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:20.93,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Finally, I can call you my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:25.41,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Now we will live together in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.15,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You deserve a real wedding ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:31.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,but the eunuch saw you not far from the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.66,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Officials are trying\Nto blame you for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.93,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,So I had to speed up the selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.23,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I was at the lake because I was scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:42.69,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,hearing a loud sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:44.59,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:46.57,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,She can't hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:48.36,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,despite what family she comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:58.65,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,No, not like that.\NI will do everything to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:01.71,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I will do my best to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:04.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.42,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I\Ndon't have many ways to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:11.09,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I'm just a puppet on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:13.09,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,But I have a brother who worries about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.22,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,and a friend who would do anything for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.59,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:27.33,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You’re rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:33.22,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I explained to the officials where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:34.55,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:51.03,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What? Well, which one is the widowed granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.14,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Bow to the Queen Dowager, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:55.43,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Never mind, walk away flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:17:00.93,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I hope you slept soundly, Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.99,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You have become so younger this night!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.56,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You can’t tell how old you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:16.39,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You almost tricked me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.26,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.63,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.59,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,So it’s not in vain that I’m trying so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.43,0:17:26.67,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Good girl, Chan Bong-hwan, keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:29.80,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,A great misfortune has happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:33.93,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What a horror, it looks like\Nyou haven’t fully recovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:36.20,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What nonsense are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.15,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,We couldn’t have found a better queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.92,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,As sharp-tongued as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:43.31,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.11,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I looked closely and I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.98,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,They smile so sweetly, but in reality\Nthey would rip each other's throats out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:52.89,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Full combat readiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.67,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Now you must try your best to produce an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:18:01.34,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,At one time I learned\Nan effective way to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,so that a little prince will definitely be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:07.21,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Don’t torment us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:11.38,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Imagine, you spend the night with your spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:13.68,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,He lies on his back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:14.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,and you are on top...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.36,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Give her the “Best Mother-in-Law” award.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:39.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,This is a very important point,\Nclimb on top and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.77,0:18:42.33,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Mother, I can figure this out just fine myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:51.08,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Just shut up, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:55.49,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say I studied the literature carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.47,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:10.51,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,How many things have you learned to become a wonderful wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:13.31,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.63,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:19.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,sorry for crossing the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:25.11,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,So, the daughter-in-law should be more modest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:29.52,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,and the grandson’s wife has to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:47.01,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.57,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Not sleeves, but murder weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:51.34,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Neck is cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.95,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You must be very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:55.52,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,No wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:57.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,we had too much to drink last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:00.58,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What did we drink there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:02.92,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The courtiers are already waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:04.42,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I suggest you hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.24,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Injeongjeong Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.01,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,State Councilor Kim Byung-hak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.51,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:05.99,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Left Advisor Kim Seok-keun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:07.56,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:12.03,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Minister of War Kim Chang-hyuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:13.80,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.53,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,And all the Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.30,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,So that's what you are,\Nthe famous trinity of Kims from Andong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.60,0:21:23.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,With the help of the Queen Dowager and the King's wife
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:26.94,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,they came up with\Nvarious excuses for collecting taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.54,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Because of them, the people suffered greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:30.85,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,In my time\Nthey were accused of corruption in the defense sector
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.75,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,and real estate,\Nas well as tax evasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.58,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Our arrow has ripened everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:36.22,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,In other words, here it is, a trio of reptiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:38.75,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,symbol of corruption that destroyed the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:40.26,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Andon clan Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.69,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Right Advisor Cho Man-heon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:51.73,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:56.13,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Minister of Officials Jo Dongmun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:21:58.44,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:22:00.83,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Here comes the Cho family from Pungyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:03.67,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,These are famous for staying\Nclose to the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.61,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,When her son Hongjong was king,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.62,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,they were held in high esteem, and then he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:09.65,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon from the Andong family ascended to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.05,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,and they lost their influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:15.72,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Now they are just small fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:17.43,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The one who really means something is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:20.85,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Troop commander Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.20,0:22:26.77,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.30,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Here he is - the man in whose hands is all the power of the Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:33.94,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Since we have gathered about your wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:36.07,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I would like to report something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:39.40,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.65,0:22:41.95,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The head of the royal guard\Nis responsible for your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.11,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I advise you to appoint Kim Moon-geun to this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.85,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,My father-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:51.49,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.26,0:22:56.70,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,This is a very important post.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.17,0:23:00.36,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The Queen is worried about your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:03.33,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Sorry for not mentioning this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:06.81,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Did you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:08.60,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,God knows, but
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.60,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I will stick to the winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:15.72,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Dead or alive,\NI will be concerned about your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:18.72,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,To make sure you are safe and healthy,\NI stayed up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:23.02,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,A snake, not a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.53,0:23:29.32,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,That's it, then I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:30.87,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Dowager Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.87,0:23:33.86,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,was glad to hear about the queen’s request.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:36.47,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,My brother currently holds this position
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:37.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:39.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I need time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:42.57,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your safety comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.95,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please make a decision
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.95,0:23:50.38,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:13.04,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your love for me knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.81,0:24:17.48,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Then, with your permission, I will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.12,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:24.31,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,a man whose power exceeds that of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:28.08,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,This is who actually rules the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.19,0:24:33.26,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Pop corn here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:38.09,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.89,0:24:59.64,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Sorry, let's continue the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.29,0:25:06.53,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Looks like the queen is tired.\NWe'll probably end here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.86,0:25:10.56,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,A night together is the time when the gods\Nhelp to conceive an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:13.12,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,We should not give in to pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:16.04,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Last night, however, I was impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.11,0:25:20.14,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,There is nothing wrong with being happily married.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.14,0:25:21.44,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.51,0:25:23.13,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What is he talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:26.10,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Then let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.25,0:25:30.99,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,-Thank you, Your Majesty.\N-Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.52,0:25:37.23,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You were bluffing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:39.38,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I don’t understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:41.83,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Nothing happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.83,0:25:45.30,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You upset me, yes, you drank a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:48.27,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,but how could you forget\Nwhat happened on your wedding night?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:50.91,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.91,0:25:52.21,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:55.57,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You have damaged your memory,\Nyou may forget about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.61,0:25:59.17,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,That can’t be.\NThere was nothing between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.28,0:26:03.84,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,You have passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:06.92,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Checking? What kind of check?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:10.19,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Virginity test,\Nthere was blood on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:13.35,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,I have something to do, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.33,0:26:20.94,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! We didn't agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:24.06,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, let's go to the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.51,0:26:29.28,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Jang Bong Hwan, he’s all lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:32.67,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Think for yourself, you would know if something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.98,0:26:34.75,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Nothing happened! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:40.31,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Naturally, he doesn’t want people to know that he’s not hardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.39,0:26:42.92,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,And he seems to like to twist the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.92,0:26:45.19,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,And still!\NDo you have to be so calculating?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.19,0:26:47.09,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What the hell is this about checking?\NWhat is this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:51.47,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.60,0:26:55.06,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Can I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.71,0:27:01.71,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,The girl will know if something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:03.07,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.18,0:27:05.64,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.08,0:27:09.61,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,This one is too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.15,0:27:13.52,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,And this celibate is worse than monks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:18.15,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Looks like none of you can answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.76,0:27:23.06,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,What a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.95,0:27:40.72,Default,3,0,0,0,,-Is the child crying because of me?\N-Of course not, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.72,0:27:42.92,Default,3,0,0,0,,The wind is cold. Let me close the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:45.09,Default,3,0,0,0,,-I’m already sweating myself.\N-It’s very cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.09,0:27:46.32,Default,3,0,0,0,,-It’s hot here!\N-You’ll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:47.81,Default,3,0,0,0,,I'm hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:49.02,Default,3,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.06,0:27:55.56,Default,3,0,0,0,,I can’t stop thinking about Cheoljong’s words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.89,0:28:09.66,Default,3,0,0,0,,Eat in peace, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:12.93,Default,3,0,0,0,,Seeing the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.96,0:28:16.00,Default,3,0,0,0,,I realized that she was still not herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:17.27,Default,3,0,0,0,,How should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:21.24,Default,3,0,0,0,,Overly impudent?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.37,0:28:23.21,Default,3,0,0,0,,She was always brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.21,0:28:26.44,Default,3,0,0,0,,but not so arrogant and fearless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.44,0:28:29.78,Default,3,0,0,0,,She lost her composure during the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.78,0:28:32.32,Default,3,0,0,0,,I must teach her the rules of decency.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.45,0:28:35.32,Default,3,0,0,0,,You cannot show your weakness to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.62,0:28:38.09,Default,3,0,0,0,,And as for Cho Hwajin...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:41.69,Default,3,0,0,0,,Are you sure she was with His Majesty that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.79,0:28:44.90,Default,3,0,0,0,,Yes, I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.10,0:28:47.93,Default,3,0,0,0,,She entered the palace 15 minutes later
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.70,Default,3,0,0,0,,after an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.87,0:28:53.94,Default,3,0,0,0,,This is not proof that she tried to harm Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.34,0:28:56.51,Default,3,0,0,0,,but you can try using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.01,Default,3,0,0,0,,Big mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:02.15,Default,3,0,0,0,,If she didn’t do it, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:06.18,Default,3,0,0,0,,Do you think anyone else is involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.55,0:29:07.79,Default,3,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:11.56,Default,3,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter who exactly did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:16.83,Default,3,0,0,0,,The more important thing is who we need to blame for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.20,0:29:20.33,Default,3,0,0,0,,Who do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:21.67,Default,3,0,0,0,,If we point to a deer
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.20,0:29:25.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,and let's say that this is a horse, then it will be a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.64,0:29:30.81,Default,3,0,0,0,,In our case, a deer can really become a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.31,0:29:34.45,Default,3,0,0,0,,Okay. Forget about business for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.45,0:29:36.38,Default,3,0,0,0,,and eat, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.82,0:29:41.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,Since you make sure I eat well,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.05,0:29:44.46,Default,3,0,0,0,,I have to take care of my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.46,0:29:47.16,Default,3,0,0,0,,I will not let anyone harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.43,0:29:49.56,Default,3,0,0,0,,Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.31,0:30:07.51,Default,3,0,0,0,,"I hereby assign senior rank within the court
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.51,0:30:09.01,Default,3,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin, daughters
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:11.95,Default,3,0,0,0,,court secretary Cho Daesu from the Pungyang Cho family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:15.55,Default,3,0,0,0,,She was also given the title of royal concubine
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.55,0:30:17.92,Default,3,0,0,0,,for her beauty and righteousness."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.92,0:30:19.66,Default,3,0,0,0,,Pungyang clan of Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:21.96,Default,3,0,0,0,,Their families are feuding, just like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.96,0:30:24.63,Default,3,0,0,0,,Did she really push Kim So-yeon into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.46,0:30:26.96,Default,3,0,0,0,,She's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.67,0:30:28.93,Default,3,0,0,0,,and this is attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:33.77,Default,3,0,0,0,,I am grateful to you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:37.51,Default,3,0,0,0,,Let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.51,0:30:43.15,Default,3,0,0,0,,I, of course, am on the winning side,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.15,0:30:45.65,Default,3,0,0,0,,but I can’t resist such a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:49.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,Let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.69,0:30:53.32,Default,3,0,0,0,,You will soon understand that I am \Nperfection, well, except
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:55.09,Default,3,0,0,0,,a couple of shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.33,0:31:00.40,Default,3,0,0,0,,Since we are so close,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.40,0:31:02.13,Default,3,0,0,0,,can I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.13,0:31:04.14,Default,3,0,0,0,,No one else to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:07.81,Default,3,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I have the wisdom to answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.81,0:31:11.11,Default,3,0,0,0,,You definitely know everything about him. I'm talking about the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:28.06,Default,3,0,0,0,,Does he often lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.63,0:31:31.73,Default,3,0,0,0,,I've heard a lot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.13,0:31:35.10,Default,3,0,0,0,,And they say the king
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:36.50,Default,3,0,0,0,,disappears at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.17,0:31:39.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,Disappears at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:42.37,Default,3,0,0,0,,I haven’t heard anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.37,0:31:45.54,Default,3,0,0,0,,A fighter by day, and disappeared by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.31,0:31:50.45,Default,3,0,0,0,,He said that we spent a hot night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.45,0:31:53.42,Default,3,0,0,0,,-He tends to distort...\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.72,0:31:56.55,Default,3,0,0,0,,With all due respect, this is highly inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.82,0:32:00.46,Default,3,0,0,0,,Sorry if I offended you. I can't help but think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.43,0:32:04.36,Default,3,0,0,0,,I arrived only yesterday, I have a lot to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.56,0:32:07.40,Default,3,0,0,0,,Sorry for taking up time. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.74,0:32:11.90,Default,3,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:25.22,Default,3,0,0,0,,I’ll say one thing for sure. His Majesty is not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.36,0:32:39.43,Default,3,0,0,0,,Not like that? Are you saying he's not lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.93,0:32:43.30,Default,3,0,0,0,,Or does it not disappear at night? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.51,Default,3,0,0,0,,It couldn’t be clearer!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.98,0:32:52.24,Default,3,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.59,0:34:43.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.69,0:34:45.69,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.79,0:34:47.86,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers! There are robbers here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.33,0:34:50.36,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.80,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers! They're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.87,0:34:57.37,Default,3,0,0,0,,Robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.02,0:35:18.46,Default,3,0,0,0,,Don’t cry. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.46,0:35:19.62,Default,3,0,0,0,,Stop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.80,0:35:33.10,Default,3,0,0,0,,My baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.25,0:35:47.35,Default,3,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.30,0:36:39.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.81,0:36:46.54,Default,3,0,0,0,,It wasn’t in the secret storage either, I checked it at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:48.68,Default,3,0,0,0,,I searched thoroughly
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.68,0:36:51.15,Default,3,0,0,0,,all the hidden corners in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:54.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,is it possible that this is hidden in the tiger's den?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:58.12,Default,3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the queen is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.10,0:37:09.30,Default,3,0,0,0,,I'm too busy with the affairs of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:10.67,Default,3,0,0,0,,So I’m on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.67,0:37:12.14,Default,3,0,0,0,,There is something to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.64,0:37:20.68,Default,3,0,0,0,,So busy you're holding it upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.31,0:37:26.25,Default,3,0,0,0,,This is not without reason, I thought about a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.65,0:37:29.99,Default,3,0,0,0,,Think out your thoughts. I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.57,0:37:45.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,Why are you staring like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.14,0:37:47.24,Default,3,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:50.37,Default,3,0,0,0,,interesting to see how hard you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.37,0:37:54.24,Default,3,0,0,0,,As a king, I must oversee the affairs of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.51,0:37:57.58,Default,3,0,0,0,,Is he talking about “business” on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:38:00.48,Default,3,0,0,0,,I have appointed a royal concubine as you wished.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:02.42,Default,3,0,0,0,,You can sleep in your chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.42,0:38:03.59,Default,3,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.36,0:38:08.06,Default,3,0,0,0,,Do you want to tell me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.86,0:38:10.83,Default,3,0,0,0,,You came to me yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.83,0:38:13.06,Default,3,0,0,0,,You probably want to say something yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.70,0:38:17.00,Default,3,0,0,0,,Since it’s just the two of us here, let’s be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:18.04,Default,3,0,0,0,,Last night we...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.04,0:38:20.14,Default,3,0,0,0,,We had a very good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.61,0:38:25.78,Default,3,0,0,0,,Okay, if you keep pretending...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.73,0:38:44.83,Default,3,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.23,0:38:47.23,Default,3,0,0,0,,You're distracting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.10,0:38:51.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.47,0:38:53.27,Default,3,0,0,0,,use hand signals?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.27,0:38:54.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,For example, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.34,0:38:56.57,Default,3,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.84,0:39:00.18,Default,3,0,0,0,,This means that I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.48,0:39:02.58,Default,3,0,0,0,,What do you say? It's not difficult, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:11.96,Default,3,0,0,0,,The king never lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.66,0:39:14.86,Default,3,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:23.03,Default,3,0,0,0,,Damn. So infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:25.54,Default,3,0,0,0,,With a straight face, he insists that something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.54,0:39:28.51,Default,3,0,0,0,,Was it true or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.91,0:39:32.44,Default,3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, was it a hard day?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:42.42,Default,3,0,0,0,,Oh, that tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.85,0:39:44.69,Default,3,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:47.42,Default,3,0,0,0,,I'm ticklish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:55.60,Default,3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.77,0:39:59.10,Default,3,0,0,0,,Etiquette classes start today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:01.61,Default,3,0,0,0,,My behavior is already in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.28,0:40:08.85,Default,3,0,0,0,,This is a crash course in palace etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.08,0:40:12.58,Default,3,0,0,0,,I don’t want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:20.79,Default,3,0,0,0,,Order from the Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.36,0:40:22.43,Default,3,0,0,0,,I want to go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.43,0:40:23.99,Default,3,0,0,0,,rather than passing tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.16,0:40:26.06,Default,3,0,0,0,,To begin with, I will defeat the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.00,Default,3,0,0,0,,You may not know, but I studied etiquette
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:34.34,Default,3,0,0,0,,in Cheongaktong for four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:38.98,Default,3,0,0,0,,Show how well-mannered the graduate is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.25,0:40:51.39,Default,3,0,0,0,,The woman from the royal family is calm as a Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.30,0:41:00.43,Default,3,0,0,0,,She does not create a breath while walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.53,0:41:02.53,Default,3,0,0,0,,The candle lights do not flicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.82,0:41:23.95,Default,3,0,0,0,,She does not open her mouth wide while eating
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.32,0:41:26.49,Default,3,0,0,0,,and does not bite off in large pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.77,0:41:43.11,Default,3,0,0,0,,Embroidery is the best way for a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.11,0:41:44.68,Default,3,0,0,0,,understand your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.74,0:41:49.38,Default,3,0,0,0,,Embroidery. She can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.59,0:42:01.63,Default,3,0,0,0,,I was well brought up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.63,0:42:02.96,Default,3,0,0,0,,I can’t breathe now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.96,0:42:04.26,Default,3,0,0,0,,It’s worse here than in Cheongaktong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.26,0:42:05.43,Default,3,0,0,0,,To hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:16.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,How to eat such beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.24,0:42:19.91,Default,3,0,0,0,,First, watch and enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.01,0:42:23.58,Default,3,0,0,0,,Shall we watch? Looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.58,0:42:25.35,Default,3,0,0,0,,you shove everything into your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.32,0:42:31.72,Default,3,0,0,0,,You used to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.49,0:42:35.19,Default,3,0,0,0,,Honyoung, try it. Wider your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:48.47,Default,3,0,0,0,,What happened, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.08,0:42:57.18,Default,3,0,0,0,,Are these Kim So-yeon's memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.42,0:42:59.72,Default,3,0,0,0,,Heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.75,0:43:02.89,Default,3,0,0,0,,Poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.89,0:43:04.59,Default,3,0,0,0,,Quickly, the healer here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.59,0:43:05.86,Default,3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.22,0:43:08.16,Default,3,0,0,0,,-Spit it out.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.49,0:43:11.39,Default,3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-This is not pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.03,0:43:17.30,Default,3,0,0,0,,Does this woman love Cheoljong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.21,0:43:32.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,You must love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:38.72,Default,3,0,0,0,,His eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.72,0:43:41.86,Default,3,0,0,0,,This is more than hatred. He despises her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.26,0:43:45.60,Default,3,0,0,0,,Please, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.57,0:43:53.87,Default,3,0,0,0,,I like snacks more than alcohol itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.10,0:43:55.44,Default,3,0,0,0,,And good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.47,0:43:58.11,Default,3,0,0,0,,All alcohol is in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:44:01.55,Default,3,0,0,0,,He was not going to share this night with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.55,0:44:03.58,Default,3,0,0,0,,So he tried to get me drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.95,0:44:06.02,Default,3,0,0,0,,We were thinking about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.98,0:44:10.12,Default,PINEAPPLE,0,0,0,,Now you must try your best to produce an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.12,0:44:12.76,Default,3,0,0,0,,Come to your senses, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.76,0:44:14.46,Default,3,0,0,0,,Bring water!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.49,0:44:15.49,Default,3,0,0,0,,To fool the Kim family,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.49,0:44:17.16,Default,3,0,0,0,,forcing them to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.16,0:44:20.06,Default,3,0,0,0,,Choljong lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.50,0:44:29.21,Default,3,0,0,0,,Honyoung. There was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.24,0:44:33.41,Default,3,0,0,0,,Thinking about this almost drove me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.41,0:44:35.95,Default,3,0,0,0,,I trust myself, but not that idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.95,0:44:37.08,Default,3,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.75,0:44:41.99,Default,3,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.34,0:45:03.14,Default,3,0,0,0,,-More. Pull it higher.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.54,0:45:09.05,Default,3,0,0,0,,That's how tiring it is to maintain your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.05,0:45:12.12,Default,3,0,0,0,,Decrepitude means that you have become weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.25,0:45:14.65,Default,3,0,0,0,,If you do this twice a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.65,0:45:17.62,Default,3,0,0,0,,wrinkles will not get deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.05,0:45:21.76,Default,3,0,0,0,,I see. You try so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.09,0:45:23.89,Default,3,0,0,0,,Why did you come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.33,0:45:26.56,Default,3,0,0,0,,At your insistence, having received etiquette lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.56,0:45:29.10,Default,3,0,0,0,,I realized what I should do
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.10,0:45:30.80,Default,3,0,0,0,,a real queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.33,0:45:32.87,Default,3,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.57,0:45:37.31,Default,4,0,0,0,,-Enough, stop. \N-Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.45,0:45:46.18,Default,4,0,0,0,,So, yesterday we went to bed with His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.52,0:45:48.82,Default,4,0,0,0,,but it’s like they’ve pumped all my strength out of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.82,0:45:51.02,Default,4,0,0,0,,all became so sluggish.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.49,0:45:54.06,Default,4,0,0,0,,I kept wondering what the reason was, and I understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.33,0:45:59.03,Default,4,0,0,0,,All because the reservoirs were drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.50,Default,4,0,0,0,,So my feminine principle has weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.00,0:46:03.87,Default,4,0,0,0,,If only they were filled with water again,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.87,0:46:05.90,Default,4,0,0,0,,I would immediately carry the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.90,0:46:07.17,Default,4,0,0,0,,Excluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.17,0:46:11.47,Default,4,0,0,0,,-Oh damn.\N-We barely saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.47,0:46:13.41,Default,4,0,0,0,,In a good way, everyone who allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.41,0:46:16.35,Default,4,0,0,0,,if something like this happened, they should have been executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.51,0:46:18.78,Default,4,0,0,0,,However, on the eve of such a happy event,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.78,0:46:21.52,Default,4,0,0,0,,we showed mercy and did not shed blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.79,0:46:26.82,Default,4,0,0,0,,But since you want to fill the ponds with water, you will have to punish all those responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.12,0:46:30.49,Default,4,0,0,0,,Who was there? Hongyong, Choi's court lady. Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.46,0:46:35.13,Default,4,0,0,0,,All involved will be punished with all severity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.20,0:46:38.27,Default,4,0,0,0,,What a wicked one. This is not your sweet neighbor's grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.24,0:46:40.40,Default,4,0,0,0,,What if I execute
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.10,0:46:42.74,Default,4,0,0,0,,marital duty for three whole nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.74,0:46:44.61,Default,4,0,0,0,,to conceive a son for the king as soon as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.51,0:46:47.34,Default,4,0,0,0,,Will you fill the ponds with water for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.54,0:46:48.68,Default,4,0,0,0,,Seven nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.48,0:46:50.65,Default,4,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.71,0:46:53.75,Default,4,0,0,0,,Listen here. Everyone who was involved...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.75,0:46:54.88,Default,4,0,0,0,,Seven nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.39,0:46:56.69,Default,4,0,0,0,,Seven is a good number.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.15,0:46:59.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,If you promise to fill the ponds with water,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.72,0:47:02.36,Default,4,0,0,0,,I will do everything to conceive a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.10,0:47:08.37,Default,4,0,0,0,,Even a boy, even a little dog, just to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.45,0:47:30.52,Default,4,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho has come to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.79,0:47:40.26,Default,4,0,0,0,,Wow, you are as attractive and graceful as they describe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.90,0:47:45.24,Default,4,0,0,0,,His Majesty has an eye for beauties.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.90,0:47:47.54,Default,4,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.88,0:47:58.25,Default,4,0,0,0,,This is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.52,0:48:00.62,Default,4,0,0,0,,Something you'll need in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.62,0:48:02.52,Default,4,0,0,0,,It’s impossible without this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:05.86,Default,4,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.97,0:48:23.14,Default,4,0,0,0,,Life in the palace is not at all sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.44,0:48:25.38,Default,4,0,0,0,,There is no one to rely on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.38,0:48:28.91,Default,4,0,0,0,,Here you can forget about quiet days.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.35,0:48:33.25,Default,4,0,0,0,,Oh yes, tell me what day and year were you born?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.98,0:48:37.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,Do you know what to do to conceive a son for His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.86,0:48:42.03,Default,4,0,0,0,,What am I talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.03,0:48:44.89,Default,4,0,0,0,,First you need to check\N compatibility with His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.16,0:48:51.90,Default,4,0,0,0,,Contact me if you need a powerful talisman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.07,0:48:57.24,Default,4,0,0,0,,I know a shaman who knows a lot about evil eyes and curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.34,0:48:59.88,Default,4,0,0,0,,Last time I was very pleased with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.04,0:49:02.91,Default,4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.91,0:49:05.92,Default,4,0,0,0,,But I am here to care for the good of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.58,0:49:10.65,Default,4,0,0,0,,Apparently, I misunderstood something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.22,0:49:13.99,Default,4,0,0,0,,Sorry, Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.36,0:49:16.53,Default,4,0,0,0,,Perhaps I expressed myself too harshly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.56,0:49:20.16,Default,4,0,0,0,,Everything is fine. Don't take it to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.80,0:49:26.04,Default,4,0,0,0,,By the way, about the heart. These are your first days in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.34,0:49:28.84,Default,4,0,0,0,,and you will have to vegetate alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.17,0:49:32.34,Default,4,0,0,0,,What a shame. What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.21,0:49:34.38,Default,4,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.58,0:49:37.48,Default,4,0,0,0,,For the next seven days His Majesty will be
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.48,0:49:39.58,Default,4,0,0,0,,sleep in Her Majesty's chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.75,0:49:41.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,Everything is fine with them already,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.95,0:49:44.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,quiet and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.39,0:49:47.89,Default,4,0,0,0,,So they will spend seven more nights together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.76,0:49:50.99,Default,4,0,0,0,,But you have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.16,0:49:53.36,Default,4,0,0,0,,I am sure that during these seven days the feelings of His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.36,0:49:56.13,Default,4,0,0,0,,they won’t cool down on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.76,0:50:26.40,Default,4,0,0,0,,Someday you will lose
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.56,0:50:30.20,Default,4,0,0,0,,person dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.29,0:50:52.42,Default,4,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.53,0:51:05.50,Default,4,0,0,0,,It looks like I ruined the sheet,\Nnothing can be fixed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.74,0:51:09.04,Default,4,0,0,0,,It’s a pity, but you’ll have to write everything again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.37,0:51:15.31,Default,4,0,0,0,,You are so beautiful that you could easily become a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.25,0:51:18.65,Default,4,0,0,0,,The only advantage the queen has is a good pedigree,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:20.55,Default,4,0,0,0,,and she spins His Majesty as she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.55,0:51:21.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.55,0:51:25.26,Default,4,0,0,0,,The queen is equal in status to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.56,0:51:27.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,Remember, the higher the status, the greater the responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.79,0:51:29.39,Default,4,0,0,0,,watch what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.39,0:51:30.93,Default,4,0,0,0,,Don’t go to a fortune teller here, it’s her doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.93,0:51:32.96,Default,4,0,0,0,,It was she who whispered to the court ladies about the seven nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:35.60,Default,4,0,0,0,,She also accused you of something you didn’t do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.70,0:51:38.53,Default,4,0,0,0,,What a shame that you found yourself there at the most inopportune moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.74,0:51:47.34,Default,4,0,0,0,,I haven’t gotten used to life in the palace yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.84,0:51:49.28,Default,4,0,0,0,,My tongue is my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.35,0:51:52.18,Default,4,0,0,0,,Forgive me, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.42,0:51:59.79,Default,4,0,0,0,,How can I earn His Majesty’s favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.80,0:52:14.54,Default,4,0,0,0,,She herself told me to spend the night in my chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.54,0:52:17.64,Default,4,0,0,0,,And then she turned to the Dowager Queen\N with a completely different request.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.71,0:52:20.58,Default,4,0,0,0,,How difficult it is to understand a lady’s heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.38,0:52:24.45,Default,4,0,0,0,,Listen, I want to offer you something\N. You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.95,0:52:28.08,Default,4,0,0,0,,How can I refuse you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.72,0:52:31.42,Default,4,0,0,0,,I suggest maintaining social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:33.56,Default,4,0,0,0,,-No really. \N-You said that you wouldn’t refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.56,0:52:35.09,Default,4,0,0,0,,I don’t understand the meaning of your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.26,0:52:37.16,Default,4,0,0,0,,I didn’t understand anything, but have you already given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.16,0:52:39.73,Default,4,0,0,0,,That’s why I refused because I didn’t understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.47,0:52:44.17,Default,4,0,0,0,,Well then listen, I’ll explain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.47,0:52:48.24,Default,4,0,0,0,,Social distancing is when everyone is on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.24,0:52:49.47,Default,4,0,0,0,,Which is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.51,0:52:51.91,Default,4,0,0,0,,Let's say we should sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.91,0:52:54.81,Default,4,0,0,0,,In fact, you sleep at your place, and I at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.45,0:52:57.01,Default,4,0,0,0,,This is distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.45,0:53:00.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,I'm still against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.15,0:53:02.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.32,0:53:07.39,Default,4,0,0,0,,I don’t know why, but I don’t like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.02,0:53:09.89,Default,4,0,0,0,,What a damn pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.50,0:53:15.57,Default,4,0,0,0,,Well, you need to speak to perverts in their own language.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.23,0:53:20.87,Default,4,0,0,0,,You know, I don’t remember anything from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.10,0:53:22.74,Default,4,0,0,0,,Maybe we can repeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.34,0:53:25.41,Default,4,0,0,0,,Let's light it up properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.61,0:53:27.81,Default,4,0,0,0,,Shall we light it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.81,0:53:29.25,Default,4,0,0,0,,Let's have a hot night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.75,0:53:30.88,Default,4,0,0,0,,Tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.02,0:53:34.48,Default,4,0,0,0,,will be our first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.62,0:53:42.89,Default,4,0,0,0,,Well, if so...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:56.04,Default,4,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Come on quickly. They'll notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.04,0:53:58.94,Default,4,0,0,0,,It is not proper for a king to sneak around like a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.48,0:54:00.64,Default,4,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.58,0:54:03.98,Default,4,0,0,0,,What? Court Lady Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.99,0:54:16.19,Default,4,0,0,0,,We could be in big trouble, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.29,0:54:18.59,Default,4,0,0,0,,How will I become a good ruler,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.59,0:54:20.96,Default,4,0,0,0,,if I don’t know how ordinary people live?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.96,0:54:22.53,Default,4,0,0,0,,May your thoughts be noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.00,0:54:24.47,Default,4,0,0,0,,the idea is still too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.47,0:54:27.24,Default,4,0,0,0,,I, of course, am ready to give my life for you, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:28.40,Default,4,0,0,0,,Where is the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.08,0:54:34.01,Default,4,0,0,0,,-This time... \N-Name plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.58,0:54:38.01,Default,4,0,0,0,,I should stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.25,0:54:39.52,Default,4,0,0,0,,It turns out my name is
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.28,0:54:41.78,Default,4,0,0,0,,Lee Senman?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.85,0:54:44.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,What a creepy name?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.25,0:54:47.09,Default,4,0,0,0,,Sen as “contemplate” and Man as “like “try”.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.09,0:54:50.53,Default,4,0,0,0,,A contemplator who tries for the benefit\N of the people. You can't think of a better name.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.46,0:54:54.80,Default,4,0,0,0,,Well, let's say. That's not my name and that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.30,0:54:57.80,Default,4,0,0,0,,-When does the curfew start there? \N-At the hour of the mouse
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.80,0:54:59.50,Default,4,0,0,0,,the guards ring the bells 28 times,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:00.90,Default,4,0,0,0,,and then close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.94,0:55:03.91,Default,4,0,0,0,,The bells are ringing, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.54,0:55:06.54,Default,4,0,0,0,,At mouse hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.75,0:55:11.25,Default,4,0,0,0,,Sucks. The hour when all the fun begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.65,0:55:13.75,Default,4,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.32,0:55:15.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,I promise to be back by this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.25,0:55:18.32,Default,4,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.32,0:55:19.92,Default,4,0,0,0,,I'll do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.92,0:55:22.09,Default,4,0,0,0,,but I won’t let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.14,0:55:34.24,Default,4,0,0,0,,Honyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.24,0:55:36.94,Default,4,0,0,0,,What kind of person am I anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.37,0:55:40.08,Default,4,0,0,0,,You always
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.08,0:55:44.68,Default,4,0,0,0,,kind and cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.68,0:55:46.92,Default,4,0,0,0,,Extremely friendly
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.92,0:55:48.72,Default,4,0,0,0,,and always very smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.35,0:55:52.42,Default,4,0,0,0,,You understand that I better know
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.52,0:55:54.36,Default,4,0,0,0,,truth from you than from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.02,0:55:56.13,Default,4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.66,0:55:58.79,Default,4,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.00,0:56:04.40,Default,4,0,0,0,,So, once you were reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.91,0:56:13.44,Default,4,0,0,0,,It’s simply impossible to read here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.74,0:56:16.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,You're breathing so noisily,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.95,0:56:19.18,Default,4,0,0,0,,that I will soon go deaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.52,0:56:23.79,Default,4,0,0,0,,Come here! Take him away and give him a good spanking!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.15,0:56:26.22,Default,4,0,0,0,,I have long-standing problems with my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.22,0:56:27.49,Default,4,0,0,0,,Have mercy, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.49,0:56:28.79,Default,4,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.47,0:56:45.04,Default,4,0,0,0,,You were wrong by one fourth note.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.88,0:56:48.08,Default,4,0,0,0,,Did a bear step on your ear or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.41,0:56:49.98,Default,4,0,0,0,,And you still call yourself a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.58,0:56:52.68,Default,4,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.55,0:56:55.22,Default,4,0,0,0,,Whip this idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.05,Default,4,0,0,0,,Really? It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.46,0:57:02.63,Default,4,0,0,0,,Is it funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.39,0:57:05.60,Default,4,0,0,0,,Apparently, there is nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.66,0:57:09.70,Default,4,0,0,0,,Come here! Take these two away and give them a good beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.43,0:57:11.60,Default,4,0,0,0,,Just a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.60,0:57:13.07,Default,4,0,0,0,,and you are already losing your temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.07,0:57:14.07,Default,4,0,0,0,,It’s worth putting on some perfume,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.07,0:57:15.34,Default,4,0,0,0,,accused of trying to seduce the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.34,0:57:16.74,Default,4,0,0,0,,We walk noisily - it’s bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.74,0:57:18.37,Default,4,0,0,0,,walking silently is even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.37,0:57:19.94,Default,4,0,0,0,,You will always find something to complain about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.94,0:57:23.18,Default,4,0,0,0,,Every little thing makes you angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.61,0:57:26.58,Default,4,0,0,0,,That’s why they called you a viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.65,0:57:32.82,Default,4,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:36.06,Default,4,0,0,0,,I just wanted to fill you in on the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.06,0:57:37.59,Default,4,0,0,0,,but I got a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.99,0:57:41.10,Default,4,0,0,0,,It looks like a lot of people wanted to drown this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.73,0:57:43.67,Default,4,0,0,0,,So that's why the ladies of the court...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.53,0:57:46.90,Default,4,0,0,0,,They just don’t know what you really are like.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.07,0:57:49.31,Default,4,0,0,0,,Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.71,0:57:50.91,Default,4,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.14,0:57:54.14,Default,4,0,0,0,,I have been serving you since childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.48,0:57:56.48,Default,4,0,0,0,,And I know that you have a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:57:58.51,Default,4,0,0,0,,And that you are smart beyond your years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.51,0:58:00.95,Default,4,0,0,0,,And since you have your mind set,\Nyou will certainly achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.95,0:58:02.32,Default,4,0,0,0,,You are an example for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.52,0:58:07.76,Default,4,0,0,0,,Although in the palace you often feel lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.76,0:58:12.83,Default,4,0,0,0,,After all, His Majesty is after every skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.23,0:58:17.47,Default,4,0,0,0,,This lady was not so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.47,0:58:20.50,Default,4,0,0,0,,Since there was a person nearby who understood her so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.24,0:58:22.94,Default,4,0,0,0,,Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:26.18,Default,4,0,0,0,,This means that you brighten up my loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.34,0:58:29.61,Default,4,0,0,0,,What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:35.18,Default,5,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Hongyeon. Get a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.75,0:58:38.99,Default,5,0,0,0,,For your sake, I will try not to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.09,0:58:43.06,Default,5,0,0,0,,I will kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.80,0:58:46.07,Default,5,0,0,0,,Better take the other eye, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.33,0:58:50.04,Default,5,0,0,0,,I will not let you take my wife and child like some kind of slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.64,0:58:51.84,Default,5,0,0,0,,If you don’t pay taxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.84,0:58:53.34,Default,5,0,0,0,,then give them to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.34,0:58:54.97,Default,5,0,0,0,,This scoundrel is a sinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.97,0:58:56.73,Default,5,0,0,0,,My only sin is
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.98,0:59:01.31,Default,5,0,0,0,,allow a child to live in such a terrible world!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.22,0:59:06.92,Default,5,0,0,0,,Don't come closer! Don't come near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.49,0:59:10.19,Default,5,0,0,0,,This madman is guilty of treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.19,0:59:12.46,Default,5,0,0,0,,If killing scoundrels like you is treason, I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.46,0:59:14.63,Default,5,0,0,0,,Yes! I'll be happy to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.39,0:59:16.73,Default,5,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.43,0:59:21.07,Default,5,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.27,0:59:24.00,Default,5,0,0,0,,I know you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.67,0:59:28.90,Default,5,0,0,0,,These scoundrels want us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.34,0:59:31.34,Default,5,0,0,0,,Why should I stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.81,0:59:34.94,Default,5,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.59,0:59:46.42,Default,5,0,0,0,,Make way! Out of the way! Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.26,0:59:50.92,Default,5,0,0,0,,What's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.36,0:59:52.59,Default,5,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.36,1:00:20.63,Default,5,0,0,0,,Father, you are back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.86,1:00:23.15,Default,5,0,0,0,,Yes, how was your trip?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.13,1:00:26.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,Sorry I missed it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.17,1:00:27.36,Default,5,0,0,0,,such a joyful event.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.07,1:00:29.84,Default,5,0,0,0,,Have you made a decision?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.84,1:00:31.69,Default,5,0,0,0,,What are you leaning towards?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.81,1:00:34.94,Default,5,0,0,0,,I decided to follow my dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.67,1:00:38.44,Default,5,0,0,0,,But how far I will go, I don’t know yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.68,1:00:40.00,Default,5,0,0,0,,How far?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.08,1:00:44.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.62,1:00:46.94,Default,5,0,0,0,,I trust you and won’t rush you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.79,1:00:51.71,Default,5,0,0,0,,But something happened in your absence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.32,1:00:54.73,Default,5,0,0,0,,The queen fell into the lake
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.73,1:00:56.59,Default,5,0,0,0,,the night before the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.26,1:01:00.33,Default,5,0,0,0,,She was unconscious all day,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.33,1:01:02.77,Default,5,0,0,0,,so the wedding had to be postponed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.04,1:01:04.86,Default,5,0,0,0,,How is Her Highness now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.00,1:01:06.71,Default,5,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.88,1:01:19.07,Default,5,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.96,1:01:26.92,Default,5,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:29.96,Default,5,0,0,0,,Judging by the way you look around...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.70,1:01:33.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,-Well...\N-First time in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.17,1:01:34.63,Default,5,0,0,0,,Apparently lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.97,1:01:37.54,Default,5,0,0,0,,I also got lost for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.77,1:01:38.90,Default,5,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.11,1:01:47.81,Default,5,0,0,0,,But you look somehow familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.78,1:01:53.35,Default,5,0,0,0,,Expensive clothes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.35,1:01:56.38,Default,5,0,0,0,,and unshakable self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.22,1:01:59.56,Default,5,0,0,0,,Must be from a noble family.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.16,1:02:02.15,Default,5,0,0,0,,I was going to say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.46,1:02:04.70,Default,5,0,0,0,,You are that famous son.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.70,1:02:06.50,Default,5,0,0,0,,Attractive and from a respected family.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.50,1:02:08.03,Default,5,0,0,0,,Smart and talented.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.03,1:02:10.07,Default,5,0,0,0,,I've heard about you. Your name...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.07,1:02:11.19,Default,5,0,0,0,,Kim Hwan
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.90,1:02:13.81,Default,5,0,0,0,,from the Andon family of Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.14,1:02:15.64,Default,5,0,0,0,,Here you are, her relative.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.64,1:02:17.27,Default,5,0,0,0,,Am I so famous?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.51,1:02:19.98,Default,5,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.21,1:02:22.71,Default,5,0,0,0,,Ask anyone on the street: everyone knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:25.25,Default,5,0,0,0,,It’s such an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.52,1:02:27.34,Default,5,0,0,0,,I was about to leave too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.52,1:02:28.71,Default,5,0,0,0,,Let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.42,1:02:31.48,Default,5,0,0,0,,I came from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.89,1:02:33.46,Default,5,0,0,0,,Dark, so I got it mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.73,1:02:41.36,Default,5,0,0,0,,Blow and he’s killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:44.57,Default,5,0,0,0,,How can you talk so much?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.57,1:02:46.01,Default,5,0,0,0,,He didn’t pause for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.01,1:02:48.96,Default,5,0,0,0,,That's why it's a little creepy here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.48,1:02:54.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,And that’s why His Majesty has nightmares every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.11,1:02:56.25,Default,5,0,0,0,,Nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.45,1:03:00.65,Default,5,0,0,0,,Since His Majesty returned from Ganghwa,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.65,1:03:03.12,Default,5,0,0,0,,he has the same nightmare every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.12,1:03:04.32,Default,5,0,0,0,,About,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.96,1:03:07.63,Default,5,0,0,0,,how he is accused of treason
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.93,1:03:09.15,Default,5,0,0,0,,and beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.80,1:03:16.14,Default,5,0,0,0,,We apologize for not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.14,1:03:18.86,Default,5,0,0,0,,Not scary. So many people\N pass through these gates.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.37,1:03:22.77,Default,5,0,0,0,,Lee Senman
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:33.25,Default,5,0,0,0,,On the occasion of our acquaintance, I would like
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.25,1:03:35.45,Default,5,0,0,0,,visit the Kisen house.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.45,1:03:36.82,Default,5,0,0,0,,Which is the best?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.46,1:03:40.42,Default,5,0,0,0,,Oktajeong. This one is the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.26,1:03:43.80,Default,5,0,0,0,,Girls laugh like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.80,1:03:46.96,Default,5,0,0,0,,when you mention the jade tablet. Therefore, Oktajeong.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.10,1:03:50.57,Default,5,0,0,0,,Show the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.77,1:03:52.44,Default,5,0,0,0,,Look how bright the moon is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.44,1:03:55.04,Default,5,0,0,0,,A great night for some fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.58,1:03:58.73,Default,5,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.01,1:04:00.11,Default,5,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.51,1:04:02.48,Default,5,0,0,0,,-Easy work.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.28,1:04:06.69,Default,5,0,0,0,,It seems we are the same age,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.89,1:04:10.75,Default,5,0,0,0,,and our hobbies are similar. I'm so glad we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:14.79,Default,5,0,0,0,,Oh yes. You haven't told me your name yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.93,1:04:16.06,Default,5,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.43,1:04:18.06,Default,5,0,0,0,,I'm Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.90,1:04:26.67,Default,5,0,0,0,,Lee Seng-man as "Loser in this life."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.14,1:04:32.27,Default,5,0,0,0,,Don’t blame me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.85,1:04:39.48,Default,5,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.09,1:04:43.38,Default,5,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.16,1:04:51.32,Default,5,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.74,1:05:02.67,Default,5,0,0,0,,You are a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.34,1:05:05.58,Default,5,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? I'm definitely a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.58,1:05:09.52,Default,5,0,0,0,,We do not serve women.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.09,1:05:20.02,Default,5,0,0,0,,Girls, greet the young master!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.85,1:05:42.21,Default,5,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.05,1:05:50.59,Default,5,0,0,0,,It’s a great honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.63,1:06:00.86,Default,5,0,0,0,,Let me pour you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.11,1:06:08.86,Default,5,0,0,0,,I don't drink more than three cups of wine a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.31,1:06:10.78,Default,5,0,0,0,,I've already drunk two,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.78,1:06:13.67,Default,5,0,0,0,,and I want to share the last one with my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.71,1:06:18.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,He doesn’t change decisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.35,1:06:24.46,Default,5,0,0,0,,His son recently passed the official exam.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.19,1:06:26.42,Default,5,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.73,1:06:29.39,Default,5,0,0,0,,Although he is capable,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.39,1:06:31.90,Default,5,0,0,0,,he couldn't get a good place in Hanyang.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.83,1:06:35.60,Default,5,0,0,0,,If you can help him, I will gladly pay you,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.60,1:06:37.90,Default,5,0,0,0,,as long as you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.84,1:06:41.77,Default,5,0,0,0,,You are asking me to sell
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.97,1:06:44.94,Default,5,0,0,0,,the place of a government official for money?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.18,1:06:47.44,Default,5,0,0,0,,Well, I meant...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.11,1:06:50.75,Default,5,0,0,0,,I just wanted to express my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.75,1:06:54.42,Default,5,0,0,0,,I know your son passed the exam a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.15,1:06:57.48,Default,5,0,0,0,,-Why did you come now?\N-Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.73,1:07:03.36,Default,5,0,0,0,,You first contacted the Pungyang Cho family.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.63,1:07:10.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,My wife is their distant relative.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.17,1:07:11.90,Default,5,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.48,1:07:25.85,Default,5,0,0,0,,I understand your feelings
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.85,1:07:28.22,Default,5,0,0,0,,about your smart and capable son who couldn’t
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.22,1:07:30.49,Default,5,0,0,0,,achieve what you want because of family mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.52,1:07:35.45,Default,5,0,0,0,,I will help him clear his name and become the king's secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.26,1:07:37.49,Default,5,0,0,0,,Royal Secretary?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.03,1:07:41.20,Default,5,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.43,1:07:42.79,Default,5,0,0,0,,And you don't have to pay me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.54,1:07:46.70,Default,5,0,0,0,,I need a friend in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.24,1:07:50.17,Default,5,0,0,0,,The one who will be ready to give his life for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.18,1:07:55.85,Default,5,0,0,0,,From now on, my whole family will be
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.85,1:07:57.78,Default,5,0,0,0,,It is my pleasure to serve you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.96,1:08:04.69,Default,5,0,0,0,,Pour me some wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.02,1:08:06.89,Default,5,0,0,0,,Now we are friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.89,1:08:09.95,Default,5,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.50,1:08:22.41,Default,5,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.94,1:08:26.54,Default,5,0,0,0,,We'll drink until we fall over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.55,1:08:29.31,Default,5,0,0,0,,Let's let go of our worries and have a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.92,1:08:33.21,Default,5,0,0,0,,Ladies' man!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.42,1:08:35.45,Default,5,0,0,0,,And don’t forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.65,1:08:38.16,Default,5,0,0,0,,-How good!\N-Look here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.16,1:08:39.95,Default,5,0,0,0,,Here, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.39,1:08:42.19,Default,5,0,0,0,,-Another matter.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.19,1:08:44.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.73,1:08:47.62,Default,6,0,0,0,,You are so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.83,1:08:54.31,Default,6,0,0,0,,And which of you will have the honor
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.31,1:08:56.67,Default,6,0,0,0,,will you undress me at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.32,1:09:06.08,Default,6,0,0,0,,I've been a kitty for 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.59,1:09:09.99,Default,6,0,0,0,,and I’ve never met such a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.19,1:09:14.92,Default,6,0,0,0,,-Here, have a drink.\N-Come on, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.14,1:09:34.15,Default,6,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.38,1:09:40.21,Default,6,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that in such a place\N we are drinking alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.25,1:09:43.75,Default,6,0,0,0,,This is not the time to complain about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.79,1:09:46.75,Default,6,0,0,0,,We thought he was in the secret vault, but it’s empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.99,1:09:49.13,Default,6,0,0,0,,Then there is only one option left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.13,1:09:50.36,Default,6,0,0,0,,In the house of the queen's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.36,1:09:54.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,But they want to appoint him commander of the royal guard,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.47,1:09:56.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,which means it will be even more difficult to get through.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.37,1:09:58.09,Default,6,0,0,0,,They want to control the royal guard,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.44,1:10:00.94,Default,6,0,0,0,,so that the life of the king was in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.94,1:10:04.61,Default,6,0,0,0,,Then the disguised guards will soon be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.61,1:10:07.87,Default,6,0,0,0,,Yes? This is a very dangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.31,1:10:11.18,Default,6,0,0,0,,If they are caught and disbanded, then
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.18,1:10:13.55,Default,6,0,0,0,,chase \Ncorrupt officials at night
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.55,1:10:15.79,Default,6,0,0,0,,and climb through storage\N in search of accounting books
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.79,1:10:17.86,Default,6,0,0,0,,you and I will have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.86,1:10:19.22,Default,6,0,0,0,,That is, during the day I will be an official,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.22,1:10:20.29,Default,6,0,0,0,,and at night as a mercenary?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.29,1:10:23.08,Default,6,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m going crazy from overexertion.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.37,1:10:29.96,Default,6,0,0,0,,You called me from Ganghwado to plow like a horse?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.14,1:10:34.84,Default,6,0,0,0,,On the way to Hanyang
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.84,1:10:38.48,Default,6,0,0,0,,I was full of ambitions and great dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.61,1:10:42.95,Default,6,0,0,0,,"I will use a friend and succeed."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.18,1:10:48.35,Default,6,0,0,0,,I said that I want to save our decaying, corrupt country,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.35,1:10:50.56,Default,6,0,0,0,,and you decided to follow suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.76,1:10:53.96,Default,6,0,0,0,,You didn’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.96,1:10:56.83,Default,6,0,0,0,,They constantly talked about Khanyan, so I asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.06,1:10:59.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,And this is what you answered:
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.44,1:11:05.29,Default,6,0,0,0,,Why in Hanyang?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.17,1:11:13.50,Default,6,0,0,0,,Joseon is rotting. I want to teach these scoundrels a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.09,1:11:21.32,Default,6,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.82,1:11:25.09,Default,6,0,0,0,,Sounded great,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.09,1:11:27.06,Default,6,0,0,0,,but I didn’t know that I would have to bend my back like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.06,1:11:30.90,Default,6,0,0,0,,I was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.73,1:11:34.79,Default,6,0,0,0,,Do you think you've changed a lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.57,1:11:43.48,Default,6,0,0,0,,Maybe they want to take control of the guards,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.48,1:11:45.24,Default,6,0,0,0,,because they understood what we were up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.34,1:11:46.45,Default,6,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.45,1:11:48.35,Default,6,0,0,0,,If that were the case, they would have sent someone here
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.35,1:11:49.95,Default,6,0,0,0,,listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.45,1:11:51.65,Default,6,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.79,1:12:01.53,Default,6,0,0,0,,Kick-ass inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.34,1:12:12.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,Where is the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.18,1:12:18.81,Default,6,0,0,0,,And here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.82,1:12:28.15,Default,6,0,0,0,,(Women's restroom, men's restroom)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.66,1:12:37.79,Default,6,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.18,1:12:52.63,Default,6,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.85,1:12:56.00,Default,6,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.92,1:12:58.98,Default,6,0,0,0,,I had it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.72,1:13:03.21,Default,6,0,0,0,,And now it’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.29,1:13:07.75,Default,6,0,0,0,,Farewell, my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.23,1:13:10.75,Default,6,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.53,1:13:16.63,Default,6,0,0,0,,I can’t even relieve myself while standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.37,1:13:21.47,Default,6,0,0,0,,Pig world, such pleasure is available only to those who have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.54,1:13:25.81,Default,6,0,0,0,,It’s terribly sad, I really didn’t want to write.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.14,1:13:27.84,Default,6,0,0,0,,Even the tears have dried up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.93,1:13:45.09,Default,6,0,0,0,,And the dragon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.70,1:13:47.53,Default,6,0,0,0,,And dragon balls too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.93,1:13:51.09,Default,6,0,0,0,,It’s easier to die already.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.10,1:13:54.94,Default,6,0,0,0,,Atrocity. Why is this happening to me? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.11,1:13:58.67,Default,6,0,0,0,,-Pour a glass.\N-Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.81,1:14:04.28,Default,6,0,0,0,,How cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.19,1:14:11.36,Default,6,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.59,1:14:14.26,Default,6,0,0,0,,Do you think they realized that blood
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.26,1:14:16.90,Default,6,0,0,0,,was there actually a pig on the marriage bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.03,1:14:19.63,Default,6,0,0,0,,Since they want to give this position to the queen’s father,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.63,1:14:22.92,Default,6,0,0,0,,which means they have no idea about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.17,1:14:24.53,Default,6,0,0,0,,Else
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.57,1:14:28.13,Default,6,0,0,0,,your heads would already be lying on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.14,1:14:32.74,Default,6,0,0,0,,Then why suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.74,1:14:34.61,Default,6,0,0,0,,All that has changed is the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.61,1:14:36.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,and the royal concubine together in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.62,1:14:40.12,Default,6,0,0,0,,The Queen will want to keep her under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.95,1:14:45.75,Default,6,0,0,0,,Puts a sword to her husband’s neck immediately after the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.79,1:14:48.69,Default,6,0,0,0,,Creepy girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.36,1:14:50.90,Default,6,0,0,0,,Given what happened,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.90,1:14:52.83,Default,6,0,0,0,,you need to stop searching for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.16,1:14:54.57,Default,6,0,0,0,,We are getting ready
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.57,1:14:56.77,Default,6,0,0,0,,to a righteous war against the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.87,1:15:00.07,Default,6,0,0,0,,The only way to punish them is
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.21,1:15:04.17,Default,6,0,0,0,,find papers that confirm corruption.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.68,1:15:08.41,Default,6,0,0,0,,They use double entry system, we can't
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.01,1:15:10.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,postpone book search.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.58,1:15:12.48,Default,6,0,0,0,,What should we do then?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.72,1:15:15.58,Default,6,0,0,0,,Let him take the position of commander of the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.62,1:15:18.09,Default,6,0,0,0,,-But!\N-If we throw the bait,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:19.42,Default,6,0,0,0,,they will attack her
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.42,1:15:21.56,Default,6,0,0,0,,and they won’t even notice what’s really happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.66,1:15:23.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,He will be absorbed by the new position,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.00,1:15:26.87,Default,6,0,0,0,,this will help you find the accounting books.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.73,1:15:30.64,Default,6,0,0,0,,As for the position, we can take it,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.64,1:15:32.16,Default,6,0,0,0,,when he thinks that she is his.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:34.11,Default,6,0,0,0,,It is difficult to defend our positions,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.37,1:15:35.81,Default,6,0,0,0,,but returning them will be even more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.91,1:15:38.17,Default,6,0,0,0,,Only a real warrior will lead the guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.41,1:15:40.38,Default,6,0,0,0,,I understand he will be a simple puppet,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.38,1:15:41.71,Default,6,0,0,0,,but it won’t work,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.71,1:15:43.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,unless he is physically able to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.18,1:15:48.92,Default,6,0,0,0,,Let's arrange a small incident on his first day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.99,1:15:52.38,Default,6,0,0,0,,And if Kim Moon-geun is smarter than we think,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.32,1:15:55.33,Default,6,0,0,0,,and will understand who the guards really are?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.49,1:15:58.62,Default,6,0,0,0,,Let's make sure the royal guard is protected,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.20,1:16:01.03,Default,6,0,0,0,,and get the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.03,1:16:02.99,Default,6,0,0,0,,Let's go to extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.33,1:16:05.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,If you already know how, then why not now?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.67,1:16:07.44,Default,6,0,0,0,,What kind of “last resort”?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.04,1:16:12.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,Attempt.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.68,1:16:19.71,Default,6,0,0,0,,It will happen anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.60,1:16:39.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,What a dull little room?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.02,1:17:01.23,Default,6,0,0,0,,Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.79,1:17:03.19,Default,6,0,0,0,,The bell is ringing!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.67,1:17:15.11,Default,6,0,0,0,,That was the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.11,1:17:17.28,Default,6,0,0,0,,She was watching us dressed as a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.28,1:17:18.78,Default,6,0,0,0,,We can’t let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.94,1:17:21.85,Default,6,0,0,0,,We don't even know what she heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.85,1:17:23.50,Default,6,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone else is here with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.58,1:17:26.37,Default,6,0,0,0,,So, you need to catch up with her and close your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.79,1:17:34.92,Default,6,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.94,1:17:46.44,Default,6,0,0,0,,Don't let your emotions get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.51,1:17:51.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:34.24,Default,6,0,0,0,,10.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.56,1:18:39.12,Default,6,0,0,0,,11.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.76,1:18:43.19,Default,6,0,0,0,,Damn, I'll get caught if I don't get back on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.99,1:20:23.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, don’t trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.70,1:20:25.62,Default,6,0,0,0,,Especially be careful with those who are close.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.33,1:20:29.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,You know who did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.70,1:20:30.84,Default,6,0,0,0,,The criminal is...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.84,1:20:32.70,Default,6,0,0,0,,If the queen heard everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.70,1:20:35.20,Default,6,0,0,0,,bloodshed is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.34,1:20:36.34,Default,6,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:38.81,Default,6,0,0,0,,How dare the girl come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.81,1:20:40.51,Default,6,0,0,0,,When I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.51,1:20:41.98,Default,6,0,0,0,,I'm the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.98,1:20:43.84,Default,6,0,0,0,,Are you holding it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


